BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chi Kung
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260210T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260210T183000
UID:7e8416cc9407df3f6d7b3817@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Chi Kung is an ancient Chinese system of exercises that help u
 s contact and harness energy in the body\, and can be a great way to prepa
 re for meditation. Join us for a beginner-friendly session led by Serene. 
 No experience necessary. Bring comfortable clothes for movement.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/chi-kung-10-feb
END:VEVENT
